<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Locked</Major>
    <Description>Rough insta tackle for the game Locked on Roblox.
I suggest using a 0.6 sens with 1820x1900.
thanks to this macro u can ragdoll your opponent thanks to the rough weapon and destroy ur enemies :D
this was the part of the first form script btw have fun !!!
:D
</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>MoveTo 951 331
MoveR -61 6
KeyDown 21 1
Delay 16 ms
RightDown 1
RightUp 1
KeyUp 21 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Roblox</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>